# Live Proof Artifacts

Protocol: `protocols/LIVE_PROOF_PROTOCOL.md`

## Required pair per kernel feature

| Artifact | Path |
|----------|------|
| Runnable demo | `scripts/demo_<feature>.sh` |
| Proof guide | `docs/<feature>_proof.md` |

## Proof guide must include

- **Command** to run (copy-pasteable)
- **Success markers** (2–5 strings to grep/watch for)
- **Failure signals** (what indicates broken)

## Demo script rules

- `set -euo pipefail` at top
- Must run without manual steps where possible
- API demos: document required env vars; offer `--dry` or fixture mode if available

## Definition of done

- [ ] `pytest` green for code paths
- [ ] Demo run observed with markers cited in checkpoint
- [ ] Task step marked `[x]` only after live observation

**Unit tests alone do not complete kernel/CLI/safety features.**
